# Ask Muskan chatbot — optional LLM connection
#
# The chatbot works out of the box in "demo mode" using the structured data
# in src/data/portfolioData.js — no key required.
#
# To connect a real LLM, do NOT put an API key in a VITE_ variable — anything
# prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the client and publicly visible.
#
# Instead, deploy a small serverless function (e.g. a Vercel Edge Function at
# /api/chat) that holds your Anthropic API key server-side, and point the
# frontend at that endpoint:

VITE_CHAT_API_ENDPOINT=/api/chat
